  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[36 - (48 × 7 ÷ 16) - (19 + 3 - 24)]\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/07943dff1edbe49721256bfb3bc7c60fe63565437e3926063350b4cbb5ef1a79.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[36 - (48 × 7 ÷ 16) - (19 + 3 - 24)]\n\n⇒ [36 - 21 - (-2)]\n\n⇒ 36 - 21 + 2\n\n⇒ 38 - 21 \n\n⇒ 17\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 17.**",
